        "collapsible_tab_W7etYx": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product Specifications",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li>Available sizes: Queen (20\" x 30\"), King (20\" x 36\")</li><li>Dual-chamber design with two sides: Firm Wool and Plush Latex</li><li>One side filled with certified organic &nbsp;wool, one side with shredded latex</li><li>Organic cotton cover, soft and breathable against the skin</li><li>Naturally breathable and temperature regulating</li><li>Moisture-wicking for a drier sleep environment</li><li>Hypoallergenic and resistant to mold, mildew, and dust mites</li><li>Naturally flame resistant, no chemical retardants</li><li>Handcrafted in the USA</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 40,
            "margin_bottom": 0,
            "margin_top_mobile": 32,
            "margin_bottom_mobile": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_wP3yAA": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why you'll love it",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li>One pillow, two feels: flip between Firm Wool and Plush Latex</li><li>Adjust to your night: firmer support or softer cushioning, no swapping pillows</li><li>Sleeps cool: breathable wool and latex stay temperature-neutral</li><li>100% chemical-free and organic, no off-gassing</li><li>Every pillow includes a free machine-washable protector</li><li>Adjustable loft - you can adjust the loft by adding or removing the stuffing via a zipper on the side</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 0,
            "margin_top_mobile": 0,
            "margin_bottom_mobile": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_THr6Kx": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Materials",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>Organic Wool (from sheep)</strong> — Nature's temperature regulator. It keeps sheep warm in the winter and cool in the summer by wicking away heat and moisture. That's why it creates a firmer, cooler, and more comfortable sleep surface.</li><li><strong>Organic Latex (from trees)</strong> — Harvested from the sap of rubber trees, organic latex is springy, breathable, and responsive. It gently lifts and supports your body instead of letting you sink into it.</li><li><strong>Organic Cotton (Cover)</strong> — The first thing your body touches should be soft, breathable, and natural. Organic cotton creates a cool, comfortable surface without synthetic fibers against your skin.</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 0,
            "margin_top_mobile": 0,
            "margin_bottom_mobile": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_qCn4mP": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Warranty & Returns",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<p>Pillows may be returned within 30 days of delivery. Because the fill is adjustable and personal, we ask that the pillow and its protector are clean and undamaged. Stained or damaged items are not eligible for return. Confirm the current return window and any restocking fee at checkout. <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\" title=\"Refund Policy\">Learn More</a></p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 0,
